OL,3,GNEWSAA 32-year-old DJ from Scotland
OL,4,Aconfirmed as victim of Krakow shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 24-year-old attacker, named as
OL,7,FMichal Oksinski by local media, died in
OL,8,Fhospital on Monday, having also fatally
OL,9,Fshot four Polish citizens and an
OL,10,FAustrian woman with a further 15
OL,11,Fpeople, including two police officers,
OL,12,Finjured.
